---
import Tunnel from '../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
import Choice from '../../components/Choice.astro';
---
<Tunnel title="Critical Protocol | Save My Gig!" status="Critical_Path" red>
  <h1 class="danger" style="margin-bottom:1rem">READ BEFORE STARTING</h1>

  <div class="panel">
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li><strong>You are in control.</strong> You decide every action before it happens.</li>
      <li>Results depend on the hardware state and are <strong>not guaranteed</strong>.</li>
      <li>You can <strong>stop at any time</strong>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="alert-card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    <div style="font-size:20px">🚨</div>
    <div><strong>Less than 60 minutes before your gig.</strong> You don't have time to fix the USB. Right now the goal is simple: <strong>play a set.</strong></div>
  </div>

  <p class="question">Do you have access to a computer right now?</p>

  <Choice step="critical_fork_computer"
    a={{ href: '/protocol/critical/usb-check', label: '💻 YES - I HAVE A COMPUTER', desc: 'We rescue the USB with the computer.' }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/critical/no-laptop', label: '🚫 NO COMPUTER AVAILABLE', desc: 'We work with the players and the booth.' }}
  />

  <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href="/emergency" class="dim" style="text-decoration:none">← Go back</a></p>
</Tunnel>
